# M7 Document Refactor

## Smell and note

`VocabularyStore.add_entry` reloaded and scanned the entire vocabulary list
just to return the row it had inserted. This was an indirect extra query and
made a single-entry operation depend on list retrieval and ordering.

The refactor extracts the row-to-API mapping into `_entry_from_row` and fetches
the inserted row directly by its database id on the existing connection.
Validation, ordering, and the returned entry shape are unchanged. Adding an
entry is now easier to follow and does not reload unrelated entries.

